sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant API
  participant PAY as Payment Module
  participant MP as Mercado Pago (future)
  participant L as Ledger
  participant R as Reconciliation
  U->>API: request deposit
  API->>PAY: create internal intent
  PAY->>MP: create Pix only if claim active
  MP-->>PAY: webhook evidence (untrusted)
  PAY->>MP: canonical query
  PAY->>R: correlate evidence
  R->>L: authorized accounting event only after policy
